  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EWI Transfront 2 &amp; 3</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EWI Transfront 2 &amp; 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">East West Institute har sedan 2001 erh&#xe5;llit Sidast&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att implementera gr&#xe4;ns&#xf6;verskridande projekt p&#xe5; Balkan. I den fas 2 &amp; 3 vill EWI nu forts&#xe4;tta med det p&#xe5;b&#xf6;rjade arbetet med m&#xe5;let att tillf&#xf6;rs&#xe4;kra l&#xe5;ngsiktigt h&#xe5;llbara mekanismer f&#xf6;r gr&#xe4;ns&#xf6;verskridande samarbete p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5;. Projektet fokuserar p&#xe5; en f&#xf6;rdjupning och operationalisering av de insatser som gjorts under tidigare fas</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EastWest Institute (EWI) has set up a Transfrontier Co-operation Programme in order to facilitate contacts between countries in the Balkans. Sida has supported a first phase and this 2nd/3rd phase aims at solidifying and oprationalising already established working groups on resolution of cross-border disputes, implementation of strategies to tackle common problems and implementation of local pilot projects.</narrative>
  </description>
